Begin "Go to William Hart"s Chart"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
	Click the "TEST-10019" link
Begin "Adding a new User"
	Click the "Add New Physician" link
	Verify exists "Add User" popup
	Type "Smith" in the "Last Name" popup input
	Type "John" in the "First Name" popup input
	Type "Rudolf" in "Middle Name" popup input
	Type "D.O." in the "Degree" popup input
	Type "123 Here St" in the "Address1" popup input
	Type "Suite #5" in the "Address2" popup input
	Type "Anytown" in the "City" popup input
	Type "Indiana" into the "State" field
	Type "46804" in the "Zip" popup input
	Type "2604596270" in the "Work Phone" popup input
	Type "2604596271" in the "Fax Number" popup input
	Type "Fax" into the "Preferred Route" field
	Click the "Add User" button
	Verify exists "These users already exist" text
	Click the "Add as new user" link
	Verify exists "Warning" popup
	Close the popup
Begin "Verify the User"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Access" charttab
	Click the "Access Control" charttab subtab
	Type "Smith, John" in the input
	Click the "Go!" button
	Verify exists "Login Disabled" text
	Click the "(*)" link
	Verify exists "John Rudolf Smith, D.O." text
	Verify exists "123 Here St" text
	Verify exists "Suite #5" text
	Verify exists "Anytown IN, 46804" text
	Verify exists "US" text
	Verify exists "Fax" text
	Verify exists "View Only" text
	Verify exists "Referring Physicians" text
	Verify exists "Referring Physician" text
	Verify exists "(260) 459-6270" text
	Verify exists "(260) 459-6271" text
